l-pair\">20-df-minimal-pair</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>所有共同下界的量化在 c.e. 度结构中，端点为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf0&#39;\">\\(\\mathbf0&#39;\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f389bdba28de0478\" href=\"?note=f389bdba28de0478\" title=\"20-df-redeg\">20-df-redeg</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e890b3c29e4a70a3\" href=\"?note=e890b3c29e4a70a3\" title=\"20-df-jump\">20-df-jump</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36e73d05a266e3c0\" href=\"?note=36e73d05a266e3c0\" title=\"20-df-minimal-pair\">20-df-minimal-pair</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\">\\(\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\)</span> 是 c.e. 度族，见上游 redeg；下标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{deg}\">\\(\\mathrm{deg}\\)</span> 只区分集合族和度族。</p>\n<aside class=\"callout\" data-kind=\"todo\"><div class=\"callout-title\">核验边界</div><p>本条状态为 pending-source；正文给出修订后的定义或命题草案，尚缺完整来源核对或独立证明。不可仅凭文件类型将其作为已认证定理使用。</p>\n</aside>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}lachlan\\text{-}nondiamond}\\vdash\n\\neg\\exists\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b\\in\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\\n[\\mathbf0&lt;\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b&lt;\\mathbf0&#39;\\land\\mathbf a\\vee\\mathbf b=\\mathbf0&#39;\n\\land\\forall\\mathbf c\\in\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\\n((\\mathbf c\\le\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b)\\Rightarrow\\mathbf c=\\mathbf0)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}lachlan\\text{-}nondiamond}\\vdash\n\\neg\\exists\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b\\in\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\\n[\\mathbf0&lt;\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b&lt;\\mathbf0&#39;\\land\\mathbf a\\vee\\mathbf b=\\mathbf0&#39;\n\\land\\forall\\mathbf c\\in\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\\n((\\mathbf c\\le\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b)\\Rightarrow\\mathbf c=\\mathbf0)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>分别绑定端点、join 与共同下界的载体。全部度的 minimal pair 与 c.e. 子结构中的 minimal pair 不可无说明混用。该 Lachlan 结构结果不在本书旧指的第 15 章（实际为 Gale–Stewart 博弈），原始来源及证明待补。</p>\n<p>来源：既有 non-diamond 陈述的结构参数修复；原文待补。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-redeg","status":"resolved","id":"f389bdba28de0478","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-redeg]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-jump","status":"resolved","id":"e890b3c29e4a70a3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-jump]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-minimal-pair","status":"resolved","id":"36e73d05a266e3c0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-minimal-pair]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-redeg","status":"resolved","id":"f389bdba28de0478","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-redeg]]；see [[20-df-jump]]；see [[20-df-minimal-pair]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-jump","status":"resolved","id":"e890b3c29e4a70a3","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-redeg]]；see [[20-df-jump]]；see [[20-df-minimal-pair]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-minimal-pair","status":"resolved","id":"36e73d05a266e3c0","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-redeg]]；see [[20-df-jump]]；see [[20-df-minimal-pair]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf0'","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{deg}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}lachlan\\text{-}nondiamond}\\vdash\n\\neg\\exists\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b\